Hi all,

You asked for usage reports that arrive without anyone logging in - the
private beta for scheduled report exports opens this month for scale and
enterprise plans.

What's in the beta:
- Recurrence rules (daily/weekly/monthly, timezone-aware)
- CSV and parquet output
- Delivery via time-limited signed URL, with an audit event per delivery

What's not (yet): delivery straight into your object storage bucket, and
row counts beyond the current export caps. Both are on the list and your
feedback sets the order.

Reply to this note if you want in and we'll enable the flag on your
account. Betas are covered by your existing agreement; no SLA on beta
features.

